  _headline: "Moradores arrega\xE7am as mangas no bairro"
  _headlineEn: Residents roll up their sleeves
  _body: "Pra\xE7as e ruas revitalizadas pela vizinhan\xE7a. Dona Cida levou caf\xE9,
    e o vereador Josu\xE9, um fot\xF3grafo."
  _bodyEn: "Neighbors revitalized plazas and streets. Mrs. Cida brought coffee, and
    Councilman Josu\xE9 brought a photographer."
